@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start by receiving the invoice;
:Check the invoice for any mismatches;
:v1: Check the invoice for any mismatches ({Proceed to re-send check, Proceed to post check, Proceed to block check}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v1 = 'Proceed to re-send check'])
:Is re-send the invoice to the customer needed;
:Continue process after re-sending invoice;
case ([v1 = 'Proceed to post check'])
:Is option to post the invoice;
:Continue process after posting invoice;
case ([v1 = 'Proceed to block check'])
:Is option to block the invoice;
:Continue process after blocking invoice;
endswitch
:Park the invoice;
:End process;
stop
@enduml